src">    <span class="v">@post</span> = <span class="t">Post</span>.new(post_params)</span><span class="ln out src">    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="v">@post</span>.<span class="f">save!</span></span><span class="ln out src">      redirect_to path_to(<span class="v">@post</span>), <span class="n">notice:</span> <span class="s">&quot;Post was created.&quot;</span></span><span class="ln out src">    <span class="k">else</span></span><span class="ln out src">      render <span class="s">&quot;posts/new&quot;</span>, <span class="n">status:</span> <span class="n">422</span></span><span class="ln out src">    <span class="k">end</span></span><span class="ln out src">  <span class="k">end</span></span></pre>
