ln out src">      <span class="t">&lt;th</span><span class="t">&gt;</span>Title<span class="t">&lt;/th</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">      <span class="t">&lt;th</span><span class="t">&gt;</span>Published<span class="t">&lt;/th</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">      <span class="t">&lt;th</span><span class="t">&gt;</span><span class="t">&lt;/th</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">    <span class="t">&lt;/tr</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">  <span class="t">&lt;/thead</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">  <span class="t">&lt;tbody</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">  <span class="k">&lt;%</span> <span class="v">@posts</span>.each <span class="k">do</span> |post| <span class="k">%&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">    <span class="t">&lt;tr</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">      <span class="t">&lt;td</span><span class="t">&gt;</span><span class="t">&lt;a</span> <span class="n">href</span>=&quot;<span class="k">&lt;%=</span> path_to(post) <span class="k">%&gt;</span>&quot;<span class="t">&gt;</span><span class="k">&lt;%=</span> post.title <span class="k">%&gt;</span><span class="t">&lt;/a</span><span class="t">&gt;</span><span class="t">&lt;/td</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span><span class="ln out src">      <span class="t">&lt;td</span><span class="t">&gt;</span><span class="k">&lt;%=</span> post.published <span class="k">%&gt;</span><span class="t">&lt;/td</span><span class="t">&gt;</span></span></pre>
<pre class="story-frame" data-frame="8" data-label="routes"><span class="ln file"><span class="file-name">config/routes.iyi</span><span class="file-note">the last two lines</span></span><span class="ln out src">root <span class="t">HomeController</span>, <span class="n">:index</span></span><span class="ln out src">resources <span class="s">&quot;posts&quot;</span>, <span class="t">PostsController</span></span><span class="ln cmd"><span class="prompt">$ </span><span class="typed" data-text="kurt routes" data-html="&lt;span class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;kurt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t&quot;&gt;routes&lt;/span&gt;"><span class="k">kurt</span> <span class="t">routes</span></span></span><span class="ln out">  Verb    Path               Controller#Action</span><span class="ln out">  GET     /                  HomeController#index</span><span class="ln out">  GET     /posts             PostsController#index</span><span class="ln out">  GET     /posts/new         PostsController#new</span><span class="ln out">  POST    /posts             PostsController#create</span><span class="ln out">  GET     /posts/:id         PostsController#show</span><span class="ln out">  GET     /posts/:id/edit    PostsController#edit</span><span class="ln out">  PATCH   /posts/:id         PostsController#update</span><span class="ln out">  PUT     /posts/:id         PostsController#update</span><span class="ln out">  POST    /posts/:id         PostsController#update</span><span class="ln out">  DELETE  /posts/:id         PostsController#destroy</span><span class="ln out">  POST    /posts/:id/delete  PostsController#destroy</span><span class="ln out">  GET     /up                health check</span></pre>
<pre class="story-frame" data-frame="9" data-label="test"><span class="ln file"><span class="file-name">test/posts_test.iyi</span><span class="file-note">lines 1–14</span></span><span class="ln out src"><span class="c"># `kurt test` runs this against db/test.sqlite3, freshly migrated, through</span></span><span class="ln out src"><span class="c"># the routes and without a socket.</span></span><span class="ln out src"><span class="t">Post</span>.delete_all.as(<span class="t">Int64</span>)</span><span class="ln out src">app = <span class="t">RouteHandler</span>.new(routes)</span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src">res = dispatch(app, <span class="s">&quot;GET&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;/posts&quot;</span>).response</span><span class="ln out src">assert res.status_code == <span class="n">200</span></span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src"><span class="c"># a blank title is refused, and the form comes back</span></span><span class="ln out src">res = dispatch(app, form_request(<span class="s">&quot;POST&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;/posts&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;post%5Btitle%5D=&quot;</span>)).response</span><span class="ln out src">assert res.status_code == <span class="n">422</span></span><span class="ln out src">assert <span class="t">Post</span>.count.as(<span class="t">Int64</span>) == <span class="n">0</span></span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src"><span class="c"># a valid form creates one and redirects to it</span></span><span class="ln cmd"><span class="prompt">$ </span><span class="typed" data-text="kurt test" data-html="&lt;span class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;kurt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t&quot;&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;"><span class="k">kurt</span> <span class="t">test</span></span></span><span class="ln out">1 passed, 0 failed</span></pre>
<pre class="story-frame" data-frame="10" data-label="AGENTS.md"><span class="ln file"><span class="file-name">AGENTS.md</span><span class="file-note">lines 1–12</span></span><span class="ln out src"><span class="h"># blog</span></span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src">A Kurt application: an MVC web framework on iyi <span class="c">(https://iyi.dev)</span>, over</span><span class="ln out src">iyi-web (HTTP, routing, templates, sessions, CSRF) and db (SQL, pools).</span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src"><span class="h">## Layout</span></span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src">No .iyi file here has a module header or imports. <span class="s">`kurt dev`</span> and <span class="s">`kurt test`</span></span><span class="ln out src">compile them into modules under .kurt/build/ (generated: never edit it), adding the</span><span class="ln out src">imports each kind needs; errors still point at these files.</span><span class="ln out src"> </span><span class="ln out src"><span class="k">- </span><span class="s">`config/application.iyi`</span>: runs at start. Middleware: method override, session cookie, CSRF.</span><span class="ln file"><span class="file-name">CLAUDE.md</span></span><span class="ln out src">@AGENTS.md</span></pre>
<pre class="story-frame" data-frame="11" data-label="kurt dev"><span class="ln cmd"><span class="prompt">$ </span><span class="typed" data-text="kurt dev" data-html="&lt;span class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;kurt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t&quot;&gt;dev&lt;/span&gt;"><span class="k">kurt</span> <span class="t">dev</span></span></span><span class="ln out">[development] blog is ready to lead at http://localhost:3000</span></pre>
<pre class="story-frame" data-frame="12" data-label="kurt build"><span class="ln cmd"><span class="prompt">$ </span><span class="typed" data-text="kurt build" data-html="&lt;span class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;kurt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t&quot;&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;"><span class="k">kurt</span> <span class="t">build</span></span></span><span class="ln cmd"><span class="prompt">$ </span><span class="typed" data-text="du -h bin/blog" data-html="&lt;span class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;du&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;-h&lt;/span&gt; bin/blog"><span class="k">du</span> <span class="n">-h</span> bin/blog</span></span><span class="ln out">5.1M    bin/blog</span></pre>
